flowchart TD
  accTitle: System
  accDescr: Coordinator, hospital and family use screens, which go through shared state to the rules and to localStorage. Screens send only hospital location to OpenStreetMap and Google Maps. The AI routes run on the server, which keeps the keys, and send what the user types, says or photographs to Claude and Sarvam. Database, real login, SMS and FHIR are not built.
  subgraph People
    C[Care Coordinator]
    H[Hospital]
    F[Patient and family]
  end

  subgraph App["Navexa app, runs in the browser"]
    S["Screens<br/>src/pages"]
    X["Shared state<br/>ReferralContext"]
    W["Rules<br/>src/domain"]
    A["Storage adapter"]
    L[("localStorage<br/>this browser only")]
  end

  R["AI routes<br/>api/ and server/<br/>keys stay on the server"]
  AI["Claude and Sarvam<br/>answers, drafts, speech"]
  O["OpenStreetMap map<br/>Google Maps directions<br/>get hospital location only"]
  M["Not built yet<br/>database, real login,<br/>SMS and calls, hospital records"]

  C --> S
  H --> S
  F --> S
  S --> X
  X --> W
  X --> A
  A --> L
  S --> O
  S --> R
  R --> AI
  X -.-> M
